 "rule": "One training seed for every fitted intervention: the seed whose difference_lora has the highest multi_turn_gain_pp among the batch-64 replicates the figures average (ties to the lower seed), taken for control, constitution and difference alike (`training_seed`; each candidate's `chosen` flag follows it). One seed keeps the set self-consistent: each difference object is derived from the same seed's control and constitution fits, so the four control and constitution objects are exactly the two differences' parents (each difference's `parents`, from its derived_meta.json parent_pos / parent_neg), all under one fit model key (`model_key`). The refusal direction has no training seeds and is its operating object.",
